_nc_ohc=cxdWWz3Q0ykQ7kNvwG8w8dA&_nc_oc=AdrlB7Wu1DYwkIZdWOTbDS8TKpxJt63wjmgFqHG8Pr8HbAAR1IVT1yBLWv9Afm4Pic4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLpJfbDgZIgTlX7yYMt-g6inDryiRpa9CNYYLGp6UFVxw&oe=6AB3CB4C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "JUST HOOPS nano", "keywords": ["arcade", "tiny", "mini", "handtracking", "casual"], "long_description": "# Turn your living room into an instant arcade.\nJust Hoops Nano is a fast, easy-to-pick-up mixed reality basketball game built entirely around hand tracking. No controllers. No setup. Just look, aim, and shoot.\n>\n**Play the way it feels natural:**\n- Aim with your eyes\n- Charge your shot by pinching your fingers\n- Release at the perfect moment\n>\n# Why You\u2019ll Love It\n\n**Just Pinch to Shoot**\n- An intuitive gesture makes shooting feel natural, accessible, and instantly satisfying.\n>\n**Perfect for Couch Play**\n- Fully optimized for seated gameplay so you can play comfortably anytime.\n>\n**Short, Satisfying Sessions**\n- Designed for quick play bursts that fit into your day.\n>\n**Dynamic Challenges**\n\n- Take on 20+ levels with moving hoops, tricky angles, and evolving difficulty.\n>\n**Pure Shot Satisfaction**\n- Dial in your timing, hit clean swishes, and chase that perfect release.\n>\n# **Look. Aim. Pinch. Score.**\nKeep coming back for the perfect shot.\n>\nJoin our Discord : **https://discord.gg/gR5SPAKKX6**\n", "short_description": "Basketball at your fingertips. No controllers required.\n\nShoot hoops using only your hands with a simple pinch gesture in a fast, satisfying mixed reality experience designed for quick play from your couch.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://realcast.io/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Realcast Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.realcast.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "com